<a href="/?g=1#guide" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; padding: 0 18px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #B9C9D6; color: #12324F; text-decoration: none; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500">레이저 제모</a>
<a href="/?g=2#guide" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; padding: 0 18px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #B9C9D6; color: #12324F; text-decoration: none; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500">아쿠아필·LDM·필링</a>
<a href="/?g=3#guide" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; padding: 0 18px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #B9C9D6; color: #12324F; text-decoration: none; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500">보톡스·필러·스킨부스터</a>
<a href="/?g=4#guide" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; padding: 0 18px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #B9C9D6; color: #12324F; text-decoration: none; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500">포텐자·MTS·프락셀</a>
<a href="/?g=5#guide" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; padding: 0 18px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #B9C9D6; color: #12324F; text-decoration: none; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500">점 제거·CO2 레이저</a>
<a href="/?g=6#guide" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; padding: 0 18px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #B9C9D6; color: #12324F; text-decoration: none; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500">여드름 PDT</a>
</nav>

<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; max-width: 880px">
<p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #1170AE">PROCEDURE GUIDE · 울쎄라·써마지·레이저 토닝 등</p>
<h1 id="guide-title" style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(30px, 3.4vw, 44px); line-height: 1.25; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #12324F">레이저 토닝·IPL·리프팅 후<br>선크림과 세안, 언제부터?</h1>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; color: #3C4752">레이저 토닝·IPL·리프팅 뒤 선크림은 대부분 <strong style="color: #12324F">시술 당일, 열감이 가라앉은 뒤부터</strong> 바릅니다. 세안은 <strong style="color: #12324F">당일 저녁부터 미온수로 가볍게</strong> 합니다. 시술한 병원의 안내와 다르면 병원 안내를 따르세요.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #56626D">작성 2026.11.08 · 의료기관 공개 자료와 학술 문헌을 바탕으로 정리한 일반 정보입니다.</p>
</div>

<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px">
<div style="flex: 1 1 300px; min-width: 0; border: 1px solid #D5E0E8; border-top: 3px solid #1170AE; padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px">
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #12324F">선크림</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(22px, 2.2vw, 28px); font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.35">시술 당일부터</p>
<p style="margin: 0; color: #3C4752">열감이 가라앉은 뒤 얼굴 전체에 바르고 귀가합니다.</p>
</div>
<div style="flex: 1 1 300px; min-width: 0; border: 1px solid #D5E0E8; border-top: 3px solid #2F5233; padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px">
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #2F5233">클렌징 밀크</p>
