<p style="margin: 0; color: #3C4752">미온수로 가볍게 세안합니다.</p>
</div>
<div style="flex: 1 1 300px; min-width: 0; border: 1px solid #D5E0E8; border-top: 3px solid #56626D; padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px">
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #56626D">함께 지킬 것</p>
